{"key":"ics/T0843.002","id":"T0843.002","name":"Online Edit","domain":"ics","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T0843","tactics":["lateral-movement"],"platforms":[],"environments":["ics-ot"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may execute an online edit of a PLC to update parts of an existing program. It does not require stopping the PLC which allows it to continue running during transfer and reconfiguration without interruption to process control. Adversaries may leverage this approach to minimize downtime and evade detection. The ability to perform an online edit to the PLC typically relies on access to a workstation with the vendor-specific PLC…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T0843/002","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--d85a6ee9-820c-4adf-8a64-2392ee70c83c","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.721Z","source_object_version":"1.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0038","name":"Application Log Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0038","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9c2fa0ae-7abc-485a-97f6-699e3b6cf9fa","page":"telemetry/DC0038/"},{"id":"DC0110","name":"Asset Inventory","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0110","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--b05a614b-033c-4578-b4f2-c63a9feee706","page":"telemetry/DC0110/"},{"id":"DC0108","name":"Device Alarm","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0108","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9d56be63-3501-4dd3-bb5f-63c580833298","page":"telemetry/DC0108/"},{"id":"DC0085","name":"Network Traffic Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0085","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3772e279-27d6-477a-9fe3-c6beb363594c","page":"telemetry/DC0085/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0915","name":"Detection of Online Edit","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--c1645705-a26f-45b2-aa68-ff5c93dfc0f4","relationship_id":"relationship--d035ee22-59f0-4d4e-9420-d26f43533b06"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN2058","name":"Analytic 2058","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915#AN2058","guidance":"Monitor device alarms for program downloads, although not all devices produce such alarms. Monitor for protocol functions related to program download or modification. Program downloads may be observable in ICS automation protocols and remote management protocols. Consult asset management systems to understand expected program versions. Monitor devices configuration logs which may contain alerts that indicate whether a program download has occurred. Devices may maintain application logs that indicate whether a full program download, online edit, or program append function has occurred.","platforms":["None"],"strategy_id":"DET0915"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0108","component":"Device Alarm","name":"Operational Databases","channel":"None","platforms":["None"],"analytic_id":"AN2058","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915#AN2058","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0108/"},{"component_id":"DC0085","component":"Network Traffic Content","name":"Traffic","channel":"None","platforms":["None"],"analytic_id":"AN2058","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915#AN2058","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0085/"},{"component_id":"DC0110","component":"Asset Inventory","name":"Asset","channel":"None","platforms":["None"],"analytic_id":"AN2058","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915#AN2058","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0110/"},{"component_id":"DC0038","component":"Application Log Content","name":"Application Log","channel":"None","platforms":["None"],"analytic_id":"AN2058","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0915#AN2058","validation":"upstream_definit